# External dead-man-switch ping URL — read by bin/watchdog.sh
# Format: KEY=VALUE lines (only the PING_URL= prefix is parsed with grep/cut).
# Absence of this file makes the heartbeat dormant by design (setup recipe in
# vault: 06 Company/Drafts/Jarvis Heartbeat — Setup.md).

# A healthchecks.io / cronitor / similar "ping on success" monitor URL.
# watchdog.sh curls this only when it ran AND found nothing critical; if the
# ping stops arriving the external service alerts you from outside this Mac.
PING_URL=https://hc-ping.com/YOUR-UUID-HERE
